WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:02.420
I'll tell you this though, Francis.

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:05.580
When they bury me,
it won't be in my backyard.

00:00:06.860 --> 00:00:08.760
And when they pay
their respects...

00:00:10.180 --> 00:00:11.840
they'll have to wait in line.

00:00:44.280 --> 00:00:45.700
We're just getting started.

